message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Kalman-filter denoising of seismic data (Python and MATLAB)"
abstract: >-
  Random-noise attenuation of seismic traces with a scalar random-walk Kalman
  filter, compared with Savitzky-Golay, f-x deconvolution and SVD filtering.
  Python and MATLAB implementations with shared configuration, data, tests
  and figure-reproduction scripts.
